PARITY MAP (web WallConnectorWidget.tsx -> native)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources (bound via P1/S8 state-holder seam — no HTTP in the view):
  useTeslaEnergySites          -> WallConnectorUpdate.site (WallConnectorSiteInput.energySiteID)
  useTeslaWCChargingHistory    -> WallConnectorUpdate.history ([WallConnectorEntryInput] ts+energyWh)
  useEnergy / useTranslation   -> WallConnectorModel + WallConnectorStrings (P1/S10 facade)
Projection (pure, unit-tested — port of the web useMemo memos):
  chartData daily byDay map    -> WallConnectorProjection.dailyBars (sum energy_wh/1000 per day, M/D)
  monthTotalKwh/Sessions/avg   -> WallConnectorProjection.summary (isSameMonth filter; avg=total/count)
  hasData (some energy>0)      -> WallConnectorProjection.hasData
States (every web branch reproduced — never a blank box):
  loading  -> skeleton chrome (2 stat skeletons compact / 3 + chart skeleton standard)
  no site  -> WallConnectorEmptyState "No Tesla Energy site linked"            (emptyReason .noSite)
  no data  -> WallConnectorEmptyState "No Wall Connector data"                 (emptyReason .noData)
  error    -> error chrome + Retry (web WidgetShell QueryError)
  content  -> stat row (+ bar chart in standard); compact = This Month + Sessions, no chart
  stale/offline -> freshness chip (live/stale/offline) on the header (ADR-013)
Composition: isCompact = cols<=1 (no title, no chart, 2 stats) ; isWide = cols>=3 (denser Y ticks).
Chart: web Recharts <BarChart><Bar fill="#10b981" radius=[4,4,0,0]> -> Swift Charts BarMark,
  WallConnectorPalette.bar = sRGB(0.063,0.725,0.506) == #10b981, .cornerRadius(4), categorical M/D X.
i18n keys (every web t() key -> P1/S10 table "WallConnectorWidget"):
  title, noSite, noData, monthTotal(This Month), sessions(Sessions), avgPerSession(Avg / Session),
  energy(Energy)  + unitKwh + native chrome (live/stale/offline/refresh/retry/open/loading/errorTitle/
  axisDate/openA11y/description). No English literals in code — all via WallConnectorStrings.string.
A11y: VoiceOver labels on every interactive control (refresh/retry/open) + stat cells + chart summary;
  Dynamic Type (TS font tokens), Reduce Motion respected by TSSkeleton. Tested in WallConnectorAccessibilityTests.
Telemetry (P1/S11): WallConnectorModel.start() emits view.opened surface="WallConnectorWidget" once
  (OSLogWallConnectorTelemetry default; asserted by testStartEmitsViewOpenedTelemetryOnce).

